Package: meshdesk
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: MeshDesk contributors <plotter-doctor@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/plotter-doctor/MeshDesk
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3 (<< 3.15), python3-pyqt5 (>= 5.15), python3-pyqt5.qtquick, python3-cryptography, qml-module-qtquick2, qml-module-qtquick-window2, qml-module-qtquick-layouts, qml-module-qtquick-controls2, qml-module-qtquick-templates2, qml-module-qtgraphicaleffects, qml-module-qtquick-virtualkeyboard, qml-module-qt-labs-folderlistmodel, qtvirtualkeyboard-plugin, fonts-noto-color-emoji
Recommends: bluez, python3-pyqt5.qtpositioning
Suggests: fonts-noto-cjk
Description: Native Meshtastic desktop and tablet client
 Chat, nodes, maps and radio settings using Qt Quick and the official
 Meshtastic Python library. Includes TCP, serial and in-process BLE simulators.
 Pinned pure-Python dependencies are private to this application. Qt and
 cryptography use distribution packages. Supports Ubuntu 22.04 or newer
 on ARM32, ARM64 and x86-64 with the listed dependencies.
